  "workedSolution": "1. $P(X = 2) = \\binom{6}{2}(0.4)^2(0.6)^4 = 15 \\times 0.16 \\times 0.1296 = 0.311$. Leaving out $\\binom{6}{2} = 15$ gives 0.0207; swapping the powers gives 0.138.",
