  "workedSolution": "1. We need $1 - 0.94^n > 0.9$, so $0.94^n < 0.1$. $0.94^{37} = 0.1013$ (not small enough) and $0.94^{38} = 0.0952$. Least $n = 38$. With logarithms, $n > \\frac{\\lg 0.1}{\\lg 0.94} = 37.2$, so $n = 38$; rounding down to 37 is wrong.",
